  "notes": [
    "Built last, after the research report, the README update, the test summary and the pytest capture were all final. This module lives in src/, which repo_state_id covers, so any later edit to it \u2014 including a prose-only edit to one evidence bullet \u2014 would invalidate both the digest recorded here and the pytest capture parsed above.",
